# Keep LF everywhere, in the repo AND in the working tree on checkout.
#
# This is not cosmetic. .claude/skills/frontend-slides/ is vendored verbatim from
# an upstream repo and its PROVENANCE.md asserts the files are byte-identical;
# CRLF would break that. More immediately, scripts/*.sh stop working the moment a
# CR reaches the shebang line, and Windows clones default to core.autocrlf=true.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binaries.
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf    binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.ico    binary
